<p style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0; text-align: justify">The shareholders elected all seven of the nominees
as directors.</p>

<p style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0; text-align: justify">&#160;</p>

