<p style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0; text-align: justify">The stockholders approved the proposed reverse
stock split.</p>

<p style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0; text-align: justify">&#160;</p>

<p style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0; text-align: justify"><b>Proposal 5 &#8211; Approval, for the purposes
