<p style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0; text-align: justify">The shareholders ratified the appointment of Grant
Thornton LLP as the Company&#8217;s independent registered public accounting firm for fiscal year 2024.</p>

<p style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0; text-align: justify"><b>&#160;</b></p>

